{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56876","headline":"高平野老爲文斤歌（题从《古谣谚》拟） · 佚名","name":"高平野老爲文斤歌（题从《古谣谚》拟）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"我圣君兮德巍巍，择良牧兮治边陲。\n感神功兮云雨施，稼穑如梁兮又如茨。\n无阶达天真兮，咸愿立乎丰碑。\n（见《全唐文》卷七一三潘滔《文公祠记》引）（按：文斤爲区晋高平令，其隐居地後称文仙山。\n元和三年大旱，州县爲文斤立碑而获雨，野老相对伫锸而歌此歌。\n详见潘记。\n同治《湖南通志》卷二十《山川》收作尚颜《邵州甘雨歌》，未详有他据否，今不取。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"佚名","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56876.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56876","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}